{"id": "EUVD-2026-103071", "enisaUuid": "e909754f-0745-34eb-880b-0b80cdf9e923", "description": "Rocboss paopao-ce through 0.6.0-alpha.3 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability in DownloadAttachment that allows authenticated users to access private media by supplying arbitrary content IDs. Attackers can enumerate sequential post_content ids via the /v1/attachment endpoint to obtain signed download URLs for other users' private, friend-only and following-only images, videos and attachments.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:17", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T20:51:20", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/paopao-ce-attachment-download-cross-user-idor", "https://github.com/rocboss/paopao-ce/blob/v0.6.0-alpha.3/internal/servants/web/priv.go#L208-L250", "https://github.com/rocboss/paopao-ce", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/rocboss-paopao-ce-through-0.6.0-alpha.3-idor-via-downloadattachment-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111649", "GHSA-x97c-6hxr-5qp6"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.3, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "f6313362-53c0-347b-88cc-c54376428ac7", "product": {"name": "paopao-ce", "vendor": {"name": "rocboss"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.6.0-alpha.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "3ca9eae0-a8f0-3527-822e-504cb01c9044", "vendor": {"name": "rocboss"}}], "isExploited": false}